{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 5343 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "8cbe95b872205ca72ee5d19edf09a30084fa185df1005dfe530e2700c18a14d6" :edb/db-before-t 5342 :edb/db-after-t 5343 :edb/tx-data [[13194139538655 50 #inst "2026-10-21T05:13:19.756Z" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1038 #edb/ref 17592186671081 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1038 #edb/ref 17592186671086 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1038 #edb/ref 17592186671089 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1038 #edb/ref 17592186671092 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1038 #edb/ref 17592186671106 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186087877 1040 #edb/ref 17592186495375 13194139538655 17592186045443 false] [17592186087877 1040 #edb/ref 17592186671116 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671081 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671103 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671081 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671081 1071 "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y = y(x)$:\n$\\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot y=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{d}{dx}(yI(x)) = I(x)Q(x)$, where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor." 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671081 1072 #uuid "03037866-9e99-5a94-acdf-a5e7b89db4df" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671081 1074 "This equation is in the standard form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwith $P(x)=\\frac{10}{3}$ and $Q(x)=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.$ We proceed to find an integrating factor $I(x)$ using the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x) & =e^{\\int P(x)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\int \\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\,dx} \\\\  & =e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply our differential equation through by $I(x)=e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot y\\right) & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}+\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot y & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we rewrite the left hand side as $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(y\\cdot I(x)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\right) & =\\left(e^{\\frac{10 x}{3}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671082 1080 "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{3 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671082 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671082 1083 #uuid "03e46a24-4c00-5189-98d7-bfa6a2a5cc41" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671083 1080 "\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(y\\cdot \\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\right)=\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 x}{2}}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- 4 e^{- x}\\right)" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671083 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671083 1083 #uuid "04bd9421-b85f-5ced-83ce-bd91ecae0cce" 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671083 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671097 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671101 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671107 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671109 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538655 17592186045443 true] [17592186671084 1077 "selection" 131